    "type": "text",
    "text": "For a static site, almost nothing. Check three places:\n\n- **Node 18 is not supported** — you need 20.19+ or 22.12+.\n- **`resolve.conditions`** — if you overrode it, you now have to include the default conditions explicitly.\n- **Sass** — the modern API is the default; older plugins can use `css.preprocessorOptions.scss.api: \"legacy\"`.\n\nTo upgrade: `npm install -D vite@6`, then `npm run build` and check the preview.",
